CPEDAL 1
NAME "Big Muff - Triangle"

# Circuit reconstructed from the Effects Layouts Big Muff Project schematic.
# Component values follow the project BOM for this historical variant.
# LED/switch indication and reverse-polarity protection are omitted from the audio model.
V VCCSRC VCC 0 9
AUDIO GUITAR INPUT 0 0.20

R R1 INPUT 0 1M
R R2 INPUT IN_COUPLE 3k3
C C1 IN_COUPLE Q1B 100n
R R3 Q1B 0 82k
R R4 Q1B Q1C 390k
R R5 Q1E 0 820
R R6 VCC Q1C 22k
Q Q1 Q1C Q1B Q1E 2N5133

C C3 Q1C SUSTAIN_3 100n
POT SUSTAIN SUSTAIN_1 SUSTAIN_W SUSTAIN_3 100k LIN 0.65
R R7 SUSTAIN_1 0 1k
C C5 SUSTAIN_W Q2_IN 47n
R R8 Q2_IN Q2B 8k2
R R10 Q2B Q2C 390k
R R11 Q2E 0 150
R R12 VCC Q2C 12k
C C6 Q2B Q2C 560p
C C7 Q2B Q2CLIP 47n
D D1 Q2CLIP Q2C 1N914
D D2 Q2C Q2CLIP 1N914
Q Q2 Q2C Q2B Q2E 2N5133

C C8 Q2C Q3_IN 100n
R R13 Q3_IN Q3B 8k2
R R14 Q3B 0 82k
R R15 Q3B Q3C 390k
R R16 Q3E 0 820
R R17 VCC Q3C 22k
C C9 Q3B Q3C 560p
C C10 Q3B Q3CLIP 47n
D D3 Q3CLIP Q3C 1N914
D D4 Q3C Q3CLIP 1N914
Q Q3 Q3C Q3B Q3E 2N5133

# Classic Big Muff passive tone network.
R R18 Q3C TONE_1 39k
C C12 TONE_1 0 10n
C C11 Q3C TONE_3 3.9n
R R19 TONE_3 0 39k
POT TONE TONE_1 TONE_W TONE_3 100k LIN 0.50
C C13 TONE_W Q4B 100n

R R20 VCC Q4B 390k
R R21 Q4B 0 100k
R R22 Q4E 0 2k7
R R23 VCC Q4C 12k
Q Q4 Q4C Q4B Q4E 2N5133
C C14 Q4C VOLUME_3 100n
POT VOLUME 0 OUT VOLUME_3 100k LOG 0.55

OUTPUT OUT 0.5
